&lt;span class="uses-article-cards" hidden aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;h2 id="case74歲男性胸痛快昏倒"&gt;❤️Case：74歲男性胸痛快昏倒&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;
&lt;picture&gt;
&lt;img
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Fig.1 ER&amp;#43;0 min ECG"
class="image_figure image_internal image_unprocessed"
src="https://agoodbear.com/images/medium/1_fndHrAK4gl-z87cuA9ETdg_2x.webp"
