&lt;figcaption class="caption_figure caption_internal"&gt;Fig.2 From ECG 2014 Pocket brain：RBBB/LBBB的2° ST-T wave changes&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>